WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.604 --> 00:00:08.226
Start every job from Home: press “New Project”.

2
00:00:08.276 --> 00:00:22.355
Pick the client — or type a new one with their mobile number.

3
00:00:22.405 --> 00:00:35.282
Describe the job: the type of place and its area.

4
00:00:35.332 --> 00:00:45.416
Choose a ready template. Standard finishing is suggested.

5
00:00:45.466 --> 00:00:53.963
The price list is filled in and priced for you. Edit any cell — it saves by itself.

6
00:00:54.013 --> 00:01:12.845
Totals update automatically. Add your profit as a pricing rule.

7
00:01:12.895 --> 00:01:27.643
Create the proposal, write the scope, then send it.

8
00:01:27.693 --> 00:01:36.150
One WhatsApp message: the client's project link and a 6-digit code.
